WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:03.590
So, so, so cute!

00:03.590 --> 00:05.360
Where did it come from?

00:05.360 --> 00:07.030
It sure is cute.

00:07.030 --> 00:09.820
What are you all up to?

00:10.080 --> 00:12.320
Anna, look at this thing.

00:12.560 --> 00:13.600
So cute!

00:13.600 --> 00:14.760
What is it?

00:14.760 --> 00:16.320
Nice and smooth.

00:14.760 --> 00:16.320
How long has it been here?

00:16.550 --> 00:19.080
For about a week or so.

00:19.380 --> 00:21.370
Huh, I had no idea.

00:21.370 --> 00:22.580
Is it waiting here for someone?

00:26.320 --> 00:29.290
Is this... Blade?

00:32.090 --> 00:35.010
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:32.880 --> 00:35.010
<b>Less Than Human</b>

00:39.500 --> 00:41.890
I'm bored!

00:42.810 --> 00:44.640
That's dangerous, Cu!

00:45.980 --> 00:49.270
What <i>was</i> that anyway, Parent?

00:49.270 --> 00:54.280
You remember how they said 
I'll die if I use 15% of my strength?

00:54.280 --> 00:58.670
So I figured I'd hone my fighting spirit 
on a regular basis, and keep a stockpile.

00:58.670 --> 00:59.870
Hey, Blade...

01:00.960 --> 01:04.000
It looks like this thing's 
been looking for you.

01:05.000 --> 01:08.000
Instant Dragon Eater!

01:13.720 --> 01:15.410
Oh, I did it!

01:15.410 --> 01:17.130
Looks like I can fire off five more of these!

01:17.130 --> 01:18.740
Blade!

01:18.740 --> 01:20.710
Why'd you suddenly send that thing flying?!

01:21.210 --> 01:22.470
My smooth friend...

01:22.850 --> 01:24.960
Look, you have to destroy them!

01:24.960 --> 01:26.340
Why would you do that?!

01:26.340 --> 01:27.600
The poor thing!

01:28.080 --> 01:30.190
It's been looking for you!

01:30.190 --> 01:31.510
Don't you know what it is?

01:31.510 --> 01:32.840
That thing's a Guardian!

01:32.840 --> 01:34.140
A Guardian?

01:34.140 --> 01:36.010
What's that?

01:36.010 --> 01:37.110
Um, um...

01:37.110 --> 01:39.590
Should I try and fix it up?

01:39.590 --> 01:40.640
Just leave it.

01:40.640 --> 01:43.320
That thing can handle being 
wrecked over and over.

01:43.790 --> 01:45.580
Ugh, this sucks, though.

01:45.580 --> 01:47.980
Did it come up aboveground looking for me?

01:57.630 --> 02:00.510
Is she an acquaintance of Blade's?

02:03.970 --> 02:05.390
Will this body do?

02:06.810 --> 02:07.520
Eh?

02:07.970 --> 02:10.150
I have analyzed the human male psyche,

02:10.600 --> 02:14.150
and designed an appearance to 
arouse your protective instincts.

02:14.460 --> 02:16.980
Hold on, who <i>are</i> you?

02:16.980 --> 02:18.430
Hey, Blade...

02:18.430 --> 02:20.410
Do you think she's the one from yesterday?

02:24.580 --> 02:26.660
Dragon Eater!

02:30.170 --> 02:33.470
Dragon Eater! Dragon Eater! Dragon Eater!

02:33.470 --> 02:34.730
Blade?!

02:34.730 --> 02:35.880
W-Wait!

02:35.880 --> 02:36.700
That's too much!

02:36.700 --> 02:37.760
You're going overboard!

02:37.760 --> 02:40.510
Dragon Eater!

02:45.760 --> 02:47.960
Phew, that was a close one!

02:47.960 --> 02:49.940
You lousy superorganism!

02:49.940 --> 02:51.390
What are you doing?!

02:51.390 --> 02:52.310
You're up against a girl!

02:52.310 --> 02:53.310
Don't you feel sorry for her?!

02:53.630 --> 02:55.810
Why am <i>I</i> the bad guy here?

02:55.810 --> 02:57.910
Besides, I'm sure that in no time...

03:00.160 --> 03:01.820
See? She's back!

03:02.310 --> 03:03.170
Yeah.

03:03.170 --> 03:04.000
Okay, let's do this.

03:04.000 --> 03:05.370
Hold on a second!

03:05.370 --> 03:07.570
Besides, I don't think she's dangerous.

03:07.570 --> 03:09.460
Are you sure she doesn't 
just want to be friends?

03:09.660 --> 03:11.540
There's no way!

03:11.540 --> 03:13.390
Guardians are bad news!

03:13.390 --> 03:15.960
If they go berserk, then even worse news!

03:16.390 --> 03:19.470
I have received a command to eradicate you.

03:20.040 --> 03:23.110
Currently, I am in 
observation mode to gather data.

03:23.110 --> 03:24.260
See, told you!

03:24.260 --> 03:25.070
Hey, hey...

03:25.070 --> 03:26.720
Want to take classes with us?

03:26.720 --> 03:29.530
You are not an eradication target.

03:29.530 --> 03:31.920
However, stand in my way, 
and I will eliminate you.

03:31.920 --> 03:35.560
Furthermore, I am not programmed 
to perform collaborative tasks.

03:35.790 --> 03:38.780
In that case, you can learn how 
to do that with everyone here!

03:38.780 --> 03:40.380
Well, Iona?

03:40.840 --> 03:41.820
Iona?

03:42.040 --> 03:45.060
That says Iona in ancient writing,
 doesn't it?

03:45.060 --> 03:48.110
This is not read as Iona, but 1-0-N-A.

03:48.110 --> 03:52.580
It is my identification and model number,
 and therefore, not my name.

03:52.800 --> 03:53.730
I see!

03:53.730 --> 03:56.460
But if you don't have a name, 
I can call you Iona, right?

03:58.240 --> 04:01.610
It's just like Claire to come on so strongly.

04:02.590 --> 04:06.180
And if you really want to defeat Blade...

04:06.600 --> 04:08.980
We can all come up with a plan together!

04:08.980 --> 04:10.060
Wait, why?!

04:11.160 --> 04:12.060
How does that sound?

04:16.250 --> 04:20.320
Let us begin discussing 
methods to eradicate Blade!

04:20.640 --> 04:21.950
Hey, Iona...

04:21.950 --> 04:24.380
Why Blade, anyway?

04:24.380 --> 04:25.450
That is because...

04:25.680 --> 04:28.950
he forcefully infiltrated my intimate zone,

04:29.200 --> 04:33.460
desecrating my chassis repeatedly each time.

04:33.990 --> 04:35.630
That's awful, Blade.

04:35.630 --> 04:37.070
Hold it right there!

04:37.070 --> 04:39.710
All I did was trespass on 
the area she was guarding!

04:39.710 --> 04:42.560
What's more, I had the master key, didn't I?

04:42.560 --> 04:43.870
I borrowed it from the king.

04:43.870 --> 04:45.180
That is insufficient.

04:45.180 --> 04:49.350
I also require biometric authentication 
and a master code genetic signature.

04:49.660 --> 04:51.090
What's this about?

04:51.090 --> 04:55.190
The Royal Library of Banned Books
 is underground near here.

04:55.190 --> 04:58.230
I had to drop in a bit to
 look up things about Asmodeus.

04:58.230 --> 04:59.240
What?!

04:59.240 --> 05:02.080
So you mean it's because you were helping me?

05:02.080 --> 05:05.140
There were 13 more instances 
of trespassing prior to that.

05:05.140 --> 05:07.030
It wasn't my fault at all.

05:07.160 --> 05:09.780
I was destroyed 28 times in total...

05:09.780 --> 05:11.040
Blade, that's way too many times!

05:11.160 --> 05:16.110
With my body being divided 
into 577,526 fragments...

05:16.110 --> 05:18.130
Blade, that's way too many pieces!

05:18.250 --> 05:23.080
And reprimanded by Mother, my supervisor, 
for 500,037,000 milliseconds...

05:23.080 --> 05:25.460
Your boss lectures you for way too long!

05:25.460 --> 05:29.680
She attacked me first, so I had 
no choice but to fight back.

05:30.900 --> 05:32.880
Blade, you're so merciless!

05:32.880 --> 05:34.350
Blade, that's way too mean!

05:34.570 --> 05:37.480
Your heinous behavior sickens 
even the Demon King.

05:40.150 --> 05:41.920
I'm leaving!

05:41.920 --> 05:43.360
We made him sulk.

05:50.620 --> 05:51.460
Blade.

05:51.460 --> 05:53.180
Everyone's so mean!

05:53.180 --> 05:57.350
I only broke into the library because 
of my duties as the Great Hero!

05:57.350 --> 05:59.380
Yes. I know.

05:59.380 --> 06:03.000
Besides, those things keep their 
souls in a separate location,

06:03.000 --> 06:05.380
so it's not like they die when 
you destroy their bodies.

06:05.840 --> 06:09.720
If they did die upon destruction, 
what would you do?

06:10.000 --> 06:13.320
Well, I mean... I'd have to think about it.

06:13.760 --> 06:16.100
I'm not the Great Hero now, anyway.

06:16.720 --> 06:18.350
Feast your eyes on this!

06:18.690 --> 06:22.800
I believe this is the 
reason why Iona can't win!

06:22.800 --> 06:27.110
You mean Blade is relentless because 
she doesn't die, even when destroyed?

06:27.110 --> 06:28.630
Oh, totally.

06:28.630 --> 06:29.960
I could see that.

06:29.960 --> 06:35.090
Blade can be so weirdly cold, 
and downright scary at times.

06:35.090 --> 06:37.120
He even told me he'd cut me down!

06:37.530 --> 06:38.860
Bragging, are we?

06:38.860 --> 06:40.250
I've got my share of stories, too.

06:40.250 --> 06:41.630
N-No, I'm not!

06:41.630 --> 06:44.320
Never mind that. 
Let's be a little more constructive.

06:44.320 --> 06:45.380
Never mind that?!

06:45.900 --> 06:50.760
I thin we should focus on ways
 to prevent your defeat for now.

06:50.990 --> 06:53.140
This is the result of my thought process.

06:53.140 --> 06:55.260
Why did you decide to look like a girl?

06:55.550 --> 07:00.850
Upon observation, I determined 
that he treats women more gently.

07:00.850 --> 07:04.020
So you figured he'd go easy on you this way?

07:07.780 --> 07:09.780
That's adorable!

07:10.170 --> 07:12.780
I want to adopt her!

07:11.550 --> 07:12.780
So cute!

07:12.780 --> 07:13.200
Iona.

07:13.200 --> 07:15.110
I've come up with a strategy.

07:15.110 --> 07:16.290
I call it...

07:16.620 --> 07:18.790
the Stand Alone Complex!

07:19.690 --> 07:21.460
Let me give a simple explanation.

07:21.460 --> 07:26.410
We directly install Iona's soul 
within the Core Unit in her heart,

07:26.410 --> 07:28.170
placing it in a state 
capable of being destroyed.

07:28.170 --> 07:30.050
Huh? But if you do that...

07:30.370 --> 07:34.430
Yes. Iona will cease to 
become indestructible.

07:34.430 --> 07:38.450
Would Blade take her down knowing that?

07:44.190 --> 07:47.170
You can do it, Parent!

07:45.390 --> 07:49.190
Get him! Beat him to a bloody pulp!

07:47.170 --> 07:49.860
Iona! Good luck!

07:49.860 --> 07:52.910
Go, go! Do your best!

07:54.430 --> 07:56.560
Okay, let's get on with ti!

07:56.560 --> 07:57.610
Blade.

07:57.610 --> 07:59.320
Let me tell you this first.

07:59.320 --> 08:01.410
Right now, I am in Stand Alone mode.

08:01.410 --> 08:03.710
What? Stand Alone?

08:04.160 --> 08:08.460
Presently, my connection to Mother 
has been physically severed.

08:08.460 --> 08:11.530
That is to say, I am operating 
fully independently,

08:11.530 --> 08:13.630
and cannot be repaired if I am destroyed.

08:13.630 --> 08:15.490
Huh? Hold on...

08:15.490 --> 08:17.470
Since your soul is in a different location...

08:19.910 --> 08:22.290
My weak point is currently right here.

08:22.290 --> 08:24.440
Hey, there's no reason 
to make him cop a feel!

08:24.440 --> 08:30.080
Ten centimeters deep inside 
lies my heart and soul.

08:30.080 --> 08:32.070
If it sustains severe damage,

08:32.580 --> 08:35.530
I as an individual unit will 
forever cease to exist.

08:36.420 --> 08:38.240
Do you comprehend?

08:39.120 --> 08:39.870
Now, then...

08:42.370 --> 08:43.340
Hey!

08:52.980 --> 08:54.550
Ow!

08:58.930 --> 09:00.310
What is the matter?

09:00.550 --> 09:01.890
Why, you!

09:01.890 --> 09:02.680
Dragon...

09:05.140 --> 09:06.020
Damn it!

09:18.450 --> 09:20.960
Wind pressure alone isn't gonna cut it, huh?

09:20.960 --> 09:21.740
If so...

09:42.760 --> 09:45.310
The superorganism is grunting and groaning!

09:46.960 --> 09:48.550
She's not half bad.

09:48.550 --> 09:51.950
It really looks like Blade 
can't lay a finger on her!

09:53.180 --> 09:54.650
That smarts!

09:54.980 --> 09:56.650
I'm gonna have a bump now!

09:56.650 --> 09:58.280
Go a little easy, won't you?

09:58.280 --> 10:01.280
Blade, you are the one who will go easy.

10:01.720 --> 10:06.410
I already know it is not in your nature to 
employ violence against an innocent girl.

10:07.150 --> 10:10.830
You were defeated because your 
attacks are too powerful.

10:10.830 --> 10:12.750
That's not all.

10:12.750 --> 10:16.730
You also didn't give me any chance 
to use my less powerful moves.

10:17.550 --> 10:19.910
Now then, please surrender.

10:19.910 --> 10:22.550
Or would you like to grunt 
and groan some more?

10:22.980 --> 10:24.880
I give, I give!

10:24.880 --> 10:26.310
I admit defeat.

10:28.940 --> 10:30.660
She beat Blade!

10:30.660 --> 10:32.940
How frustrating!

10:31.640 --> 10:33.630
That's amazing, Iona!

10:36.370 --> 10:38.200
Ow...

10:41.230 --> 10:42.300
Iona.

10:52.350 --> 10:54.590
V for victory.

11:00.150 --> 11:01.760
You're not gonna eat it?!

11:01.760 --> 11:03.470
Or wait, can you even eat?

11:03.700 --> 11:08.710
I am equipped to break down and 
absorb organic matter as energy.

11:08.710 --> 11:09.730
However...

11:09.940 --> 11:11.610
You're not feeling hungry?

11:11.610 --> 11:15.990
I believe she's lost motivation 
after defeating Blade, her target,

11:15.990 --> 11:18.320
resulting in burnout syndrome.

11:18.320 --> 11:20.740
But doesn't that only apply to humans?

11:22.430 --> 11:26.390
If I am met with a matter that 
I cannot resolve on my own,

11:26.390 --> 11:28.620
would it be best to discuss it with others?

11:28.880 --> 11:30.800
If you've got problems, tell us about them!

11:30.800 --> 11:33.560
We're all your friends.

11:33.560 --> 11:37.460
In times like these, I would always 
turn to Mother for guidance.

11:37.460 --> 11:39.630
Who is this Mother?

11:39.630 --> 11:41.910
She means the Mother Computer.

11:41.910 --> 11:43.950
The one who supervises Iona.

11:43.950 --> 11:46.430
Whenever I complete a given command,

11:46.430 --> 11:49.930
I report it to Mother and 
am assigned my next mission.

11:49.930 --> 11:53.130
However, even though I have 
restored the connection,

11:53.130 --> 11:55.770
Mother continues to refuse it.

11:56.910 --> 12:00.850
For abandoning my duties, unilaterally 
blocking the connection, and other reasons,

12:00.850 --> 12:04.480
it seems that I have been declared a 
defective unit and my terminal login expunged.

12:04.480 --> 12:06.320
So you mean... you got fired?

12:06.580 --> 12:08.580
What are these other reasons?

12:08.580 --> 12:12.890
Transmitting around 15 terabytes' worth 
of written abuse aimed at Mother.

12:12.890 --> 12:14.210
There's your reason.

12:14.210 --> 12:18.070
I am feeling terribly insecure, 
now that I am without a supervisor.

12:18.070 --> 12:19.960
Peek. Stare.

12:19.960 --> 12:21.140
Blade.

12:21.140 --> 12:23.130
Can I call you Master?

12:23.130 --> 12:24.090
No way!

12:24.380 --> 12:27.950
You're asking me to take the 
place of your supervisor, right?

12:27.950 --> 12:29.790
That is unfortunate.

12:29.790 --> 12:33.360
If I do not have you become my master, 
the counter will keep ticking.

12:33.360 --> 12:34.230
Counter?

12:34.510 --> 12:35.200
Yes.

12:35.200 --> 12:38.930
To prevent them turning berserker 
without a chain of command,

12:38.930 --> 12:41.860
all Guardians have a 
self-destruct program installed.

12:42.880 --> 12:44.740
What?!

12:47.800 --> 12:49.870
It looks like it decrements every second,

12:49.870 --> 12:52.750
which means we have a 
little over 84 hours left.

12:52.750 --> 12:54.160
Do not fear.

12:54.160 --> 12:57.180
My intent is to self-destruct in a 
location with no one else around.

12:57.180 --> 12:58.880
That's not the issue here!

12:59.130 --> 13:00.830
Ah, I get it already.

13:00.830 --> 13:04.630
That counter should stop if I become 
your master or whatever, right?

13:04.960 --> 13:06.510
Yes, most likely.

13:06.510 --> 13:08.340
I'll do it then.

13:08.340 --> 13:10.010
I'll be your master.

13:10.810 --> 13:13.770
Thank you very much, Master.

13:18.590 --> 13:20.650
Here you go, Master.

13:21.260 --> 13:23.000
Tonkatsu curry!

13:23.000 --> 13:25.650
By the way, what's with the getup?

13:24.140 --> 13:25.650
It's so spicy!

13:25.950 --> 13:28.690
It is an ancient attire for servants.

13:29.210 --> 13:31.740
If you command me to stop wearing it, I will.

13:31.740 --> 13:34.080
No, you don't have to stop.

13:34.080 --> 13:35.360
I have received your command.

13:35.360 --> 13:37.720
I will cease to stop wearing it.

13:37.720 --> 13:39.630
What is your next command?

13:39.630 --> 13:42.490
It's nice having you take care of me,

13:42.490 --> 13:44.630
but it feels like I've lost my freedom.

13:44.630 --> 13:47.430
She provides us with food and snacks!

13:47.430 --> 13:48.890
That's a good thing!

13:49.630 --> 13:50.890
No, it's not.

13:50.890 --> 13:52.180
Sophie?

13:52.180 --> 13:53.230
What's wrong?

13:53.230 --> 13:55.770
If you've got something to say,
 then you should say it.

13:55.770 --> 13:57.230
Is that a command?

13:57.230 --> 13:59.090
Huh? Yeah, sure.

13:59.090 --> 14:00.630
That is not fair, Master.

14:00.630 --> 14:04.440
You will not command me, 
yet you do so for Miss Sophie.

14:04.440 --> 14:05.400
You be quiet.

14:05.700 --> 14:07.900
Oh, is that a command?

14:10.020 --> 14:11.730
I don't like this.

14:10.690 --> 14:13.160
Get off him!

14:11.730 --> 14:13.160
What don't you like?

14:13.160 --> 14:15.120
She's stealing my character traits!

14:15.430 --> 14:16.120
Huh?

14:16.530 --> 14:18.340
She's stealing my character traits.

14:18.340 --> 14:20.440
For one, my expressionless face.

14:20.440 --> 14:22.610
I am not expressionless.

14:22.610 --> 14:25.640
I have 800 different facial 
expressions installed.

14:25.640 --> 14:27.840
Also, how I wait for commands.

14:27.840 --> 14:29.200
That is inevitable.

14:29.200 --> 14:31.640
I am simply following my 
instincts as an android.

14:31.640 --> 14:33.040
Stare...

14:33.040 --> 14:35.840
You don't ever give me commands.

14:35.840 --> 14:38.570
Yet here you are, ordering Iona around.

14:38.570 --> 14:39.900
This isn't fair.

14:39.900 --> 14:44.560
In that case, let us see which of 
us is more deserving of Master.

14:44.560 --> 14:45.900
Eh? Eh?!

14:45.900 --> 14:47.760
I've heard of this!

14:47.760 --> 14:50.120
This is what they call a scene of carnage!

14:50.120 --> 14:51.820
Let there be blood!

14:52.500 --> 14:55.320
I'm begging you, 
please don't cause any trouble.

14:55.320 --> 14:56.830
Is that a command?

14:57.060 --> 14:58.830
Y-Yeah.

15:04.620 --> 15:05.590
Meow.

15:06.230 --> 15:08.320
No, don't give me that.

15:08.320 --> 15:09.430
What are you doing?

15:09.430 --> 15:10.530
Establishing my character.

15:10.530 --> 15:12.510
Do you think I can beat Iona now?

15:12.860 --> 15:13.980
I see.

15:13.980 --> 15:15.970
It seems we both had the same idea.

15:15.970 --> 15:18.320
Let us have a staring contest instead.

15:18.320 --> 15:20.000
Just what I wanted.

15:20.000 --> 15:21.600
I don't care anymore.

15:26.750 --> 15:28.360
An unarmed showdown?

15:28.600 --> 15:32.160
They couldn't settle the staring contest 
even after a whole day had passed.

15:33.030 --> 15:35.370
It seems I will have to resort to this.

15:36.080 --> 15:37.870
Artificial Great Hero Power.

15:40.870 --> 15:42.960
This is supposed to be unarmed combat!

15:42.960 --> 15:44.750
Both of you are disqualified.

15:46.830 --> 15:49.880
Master. Which of us is more skilled?

15:51.120 --> 15:53.390
Pick the one that feels nicer.

15:54.660 --> 15:56.730
I can't tell the difference.

15:58.350 --> 15:58.890
Huh?

15:59.190 --> 16:01.640
You're going to watch me as I'm fast asleep?

16:02.330 --> 16:04.270
What kind of showdown is this, even?

16:04.630 --> 16:10.000
The one to serve Master must be 
someone who always puts you at ease.

16:10.000 --> 16:11.440
Go on, Blade.

16:11.440 --> 16:12.530
Sleep like a baby.

16:14.810 --> 16:16.730
Okay, I'm turning the lights off.

16:23.640 --> 16:26.540
Feel free to go to sleep if 
you are tired, Miss Sophie.

16:26.800 --> 16:29.030
I've undergone sleep training.

16:29.030 --> 16:31.690
I can keep going for up to seven days.

16:31.690 --> 16:34.550
I do not require sleep in the first place.

16:37.630 --> 16:40.640
It seems we will not decide 
a victor today, either.

16:40.640 --> 16:41.740
Agreed.

16:43.280 --> 16:48.820
Lately, I feel as though I would be 
okay if we never settled this matter.

16:49.410 --> 16:51.960
I have always been alone.

16:52.600 --> 16:56.070
Always alone, for such a long time.

16:56.440 --> 16:59.580
He was the only one who would come visit me.

16:59.830 --> 17:01.940
I was all alone as well.

17:02.470 --> 17:05.830
All alone in my cage in that dark lab.

17:06.070 --> 17:08.360
I was nobody.

17:08.360 --> 17:13.440
The single link I had was 
my worth as his replica.

17:14.080 --> 17:18.090
I was able to stay linked with the 
world because he was there for me.

17:18.340 --> 17:20.050
That's how I felt.

17:20.050 --> 17:22.570
I also felt the same way.

17:24.140 --> 17:29.660
It seems that you have become 
someone special to me as well.

17:29.660 --> 17:30.940
What should I do about this?

17:31.200 --> 17:32.570
I'm not sure.

17:32.870 --> 17:37.190
But this feeling when I compete against you...

17:37.190 --> 17:39.370
Am I having fun?

17:39.370 --> 17:41.800
I do not know the answer to that question.

17:41.800 --> 17:43.000
Miss Sophie.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.540
As a human, you are better equipped to...

17:44.540 --> 17:45.540
Sophie.

17:45.900 --> 17:46.560
Pardon?

17:47.040 --> 17:49.290
Just call me Sophie.

17:49.550 --> 17:50.920
No title needed.

17:53.430 --> 17:55.520
Understood, Sophie.

18:02.480 --> 18:04.710
Good morning, Sophie.

18:05.860 --> 18:07.440
Good morning, Iona.

18:07.440 --> 18:10.610
Looks like you two are good friends now.

18:10.610 --> 18:12.940
Well? Are you having fun at school?

18:13.200 --> 18:14.940
Yes. Very much so.

18:16.940 --> 18:19.420
Iona. Show me the counter.

18:19.910 --> 18:21.570
Is that a command?

18:21.890 --> 18:23.830
That's right. Show me.

18:29.290 --> 18:30.150
It's gone down!

18:30.150 --> 18:30.960
But why?

18:31.740 --> 18:33.760
So it didn't work...

18:33.760 --> 18:36.550
I would not say that 
there has been no effect.

18:36.550 --> 18:40.160
The progression of the counter has 
slowed down to one-tenth the speed.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.470
Let me take a look.

18:41.770 --> 18:47.250
I was afraid that a human as your master 
wouldn't work, not even when it's a superorganism.

18:47.250 --> 18:49.690
Looks like there's about 20 hours left.

18:51.210 --> 18:52.690
What do you want to do?

18:54.320 --> 18:55.460
I would...

19:01.680 --> 19:04.250
If possible, until the last moment,

19:04.250 --> 19:08.250
I would like to be with you 
all for as long as possible.

19:08.880 --> 19:09.880
Iona...

19:10.600 --> 19:12.740
After that, I will go by myself.

19:12.740 --> 19:16.250
I do not wish to cause 
injury to anyone around me.

19:18.960 --> 19:24.470
Let's get the "Send Iona Off 
with a Smile" party underway!

19:28.760 --> 19:31.980
Is it all right for me to remain here?

19:32.240 --> 19:33.210
Yeah.

19:33.210 --> 19:36.360
Everyone is trying to 
make your wish come true.

19:38.080 --> 19:39.760
So, Iona...

19:39.760 --> 19:42.990
You should also enjoy this 
time as much as you can.

19:43.220 --> 19:46.390
I don't mean that as a command,
 but as your friend.

19:46.390 --> 19:47.240
Yes.

20:03.680 --> 20:04.680
Anna.

20:05.110 --> 20:06.550
Did you find that idiot?

20:06.950 --> 20:11.180
We've looked all over the campus, 
but he's nowhere to be found.

20:11.180 --> 20:15.190
Where has that Blade gone 
off to at a time like this?

20:23.810 --> 20:24.950
Iona!

20:27.870 --> 20:30.200
Thank you very much for today.

20:30.500 --> 20:32.950
I am destined to expire soon.

20:32.950 --> 20:37.360
What meaning is there in appending a 
meager amount of data to my memory?

20:38.000 --> 20:40.590
At first, I could not understand it.

20:40.590 --> 20:43.600
However, after spending time with you all,

20:43.600 --> 20:48.980
in the moment before destruction, 
I see myself for the first time

20:48.980 --> 20:51.460
and feel as though I understand you humans.

20:52.460 --> 20:53.640
Sophie.

20:53.640 --> 20:58.610
I was less than human, but thanks to you,
 I was able to become human.

21:01.280 --> 21:03.630
Please give Master my regards.

21:04.580 --> 21:05.530
Claire.

21:05.530 --> 21:08.300
I still remember the warmth of your hands.

21:08.800 --> 21:09.830
Yessica.

21:09.830 --> 21:12.250
I would have liked to have 
more girl talk with you.

21:12.520 --> 21:13.370
Mao.

21:13.370 --> 21:16.560
I leave it to you to eradicate Master.

21:16.560 --> 21:17.490
Cu.

21:17.490 --> 21:20.130
It is fine to be mischievous,
 so please grow to be fine and mighty.

21:23.380 --> 21:25.630
Finally, Earnest...

21:27.640 --> 21:31.170
The truth is that I am scared.

21:31.980 --> 21:33.270
I do not want to go away.

21:37.340 --> 21:38.770
Help me.

21:40.020 --> 21:41.520
I'm sorry, Iona!

21:41.520 --> 21:42.440
I'm so sorry.

21:42.440 --> 21:43.940
Do not forget me!

21:43.940 --> 21:46.200
Please, do not forget me!

21:46.200 --> 21:47.250
I won't forget you!

21:47.250 --> 21:48.200
I won't, either!

21:48.200 --> 21:49.950
I won't forget!

21:49.950 --> 21:52.580
I won't forget you. I swear.

21:53.360 --> 21:54.460
Thank you.

21:54.900 --> 21:56.210
Farewell.

22:03.170 --> 22:03.980
Huh?

22:05.080 --> 22:06.800
She's not detonating.

22:06.800 --> 22:08.710
What's going on here?

22:08.710 --> 22:09.890
It should already be time.

22:14.310 --> 22:16.520
Oh, this is where it leads?

22:17.670 --> 22:19.740
Huh? Where's the party?

22:19.740 --> 22:22.070
Wait, is there no food left for me?

22:23.700 --> 22:24.770
Blade!

22:24.770 --> 22:28.240
Where have you been this whole time, 
skipping the party like that?!

22:28.240 --> 22:30.400
Ah, I went to go see Mother.

22:30.400 --> 22:31.030
What?

22:31.840 --> 22:32.940
Why?

22:32.940 --> 22:37.260
Well, you were gonna explode 
because Mother fired you, right?

22:37.260 --> 22:38.290
That's why...

22:38.770 --> 22:40.290
I went to go persuade her.

22:40.990 --> 22:42.560
With a bit of brute force, as well.

22:45.670 --> 22:48.490
The connection with Mother has been restored.

22:48.490 --> 22:49.740
Does that mean...

22:49.740 --> 22:52.930
Currently, the self-destruct program...

22:53.450 --> 22:55.310
has met none of its parameters to activate.

22:58.860 --> 23:00.510
Sophie, I...

23:00.510 --> 23:01.310
Yes.

23:01.760 --> 23:04.320
What you want most right now.

23:04.320 --> 23:06.140
You should go and do it.

23:09.320 --> 23:10.200
If that was the case—

23:10.200 --> 23:11.320
Master!

23:11.490 --> 23:13.830
Master! Master!

23:14.160 --> 23:15.330
Master!

23:15.330 --> 23:16.180
Master!

23:16.180 --> 23:18.420
Well? Not going to stop her?

23:18.420 --> 23:19.490
Just for today...

23:19.490 --> 23:21.330
Master!

23:22.630 --> 23:24.210
Can't breathe...

23:24.210 --> 23:25.460
Master!

23:25.460 --> 23:27.460
I changed my mind after all!

23:27.460 --> 23:28.610
Get off!

23:28.610 --> 23:31.120
Get off him!

23:34.510 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.350 --> 23:39.980
<b>The Superorganism Suppression Committee</b>
